{
  "description": "Documents validate.go and the front end's validate.js must agree on. Each case changes document.json: every set entry puts value at path (object keys and array indexes). A case with an error is refused by both, with an issue at that path; one without is accepted by both. Read by TestValidationCorpus and validate.test.js.",
